DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nNutrition\nSynopsis\n:\nWeight is a fundamental aspec
	t of our health\, not just physically but emotionally as well. This sessio
	n shares on weight management and lifestyle in the context of a busy offic
	e worker to help increase the understanding of what weight is and what are
	 the healthy ways that can be used to manage weight in the context of a bu
	sy lifestyle.\nSpeaker\n:\nDr. Mathew Tan\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webe
	x)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, yo
	u must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs
	1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZB
	NJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This w
	ill install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streami
	ng experience!\n \nJoin meeting <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m44c
	e5342fba69de5b132394fdafdb154> \n \nMore ways to join:\n \n \nJoin from th
	e meeting link\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m44ce5342fba69de5b132
	394fdafdb154 <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m44ce5342fba69de5b13239
	4fdafdb154> \n \n \n \nJoin by meeting number \nMeeting number (access cod
	e): 2513 853 9703 \nMeeting password: FFW2023\n \n \n \nTap to join from a
	 mobile device (attendees only)\n+65-3157-6442\,\,25138539703## <tel:%2B65
	-3157-6442\,\,*01*25138539703%23%23*01*>  Singapore Toll\n \n \nJoin by ph
	one\n+65-3157-6442 Singapore Toll\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.web
	ex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=me7de43cf94150ee1994ad787eab46b41> \n \n 
	\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n
